         <div n="1">
            <interp corresp="second_year">The second year of King Zhuangxiang of Qin, 248 BC; the king is the subject.</interp>
            <interp corresp="settled_Taiyuan">定太原: the Tables and the Hereditary Houses (§2, §3) give the campaign as the taking of Yuci and thirty-seven cities, and the Hereditary House of Yan adds that Qin set up Taiyuan Commandery.</interp>
